- Keeping root `pyproject.toml` after deleting `lib/` → broken uv workspace.
- Keeping stale README/runbooks → users run deleted root scripts.
- Deleting `docs/superpowers/**` → loses design/PDD decision history.
- Deleting `.pi/agents/**` safe only if no one still uses legacy agent prompts.
- Skill `resultados.json/spec.json` currently embed absolute source paths after wrapper run; not cleanup blocker, future portability polish.

